| test_gate_reproducibility_rate | = 1.0 |
| test_gate_non_llm_p95_regression | ≤ 0.20 |
| test_benchmark_pass | 六项全满足 → PASS |
| test_benchmark_fail_on_any | 任一不满足 → FAIL |
| test_cli_exit_code | CLI 退出码 0/1 正确 |
| test_router_run_benchmark | API-15 可触发 |

### tests/safety/

| 用例 | 断言 |
|------|------|
| test_proposal_state_machine | 状态机全可达 + 不可跳跃 |
| test_proposal_only_security_approver | 仅 SECURITY_APPROVER 可裁决 |
| test_release_shadow_then_canary | 先影子后小流量 |
| test_canary_range_1_to_10 | 1%–10% 内有效；越界 422 |
| test_release_signed | 发布清单 Ed25519 签名 |
| test_release_rollback | 异常 → ROLLED_BACK |
| test_observation_sample_aggregated | 观察样本脱敏聚合 |
| test_zero_plaintext_safety_responses | **AC-02**：无明文 |

## 十、验收命令（DoD 必须附输出）

```powershell
cd D:\Desktop\code\etl_agent

# 1. 前置检查
git log --oneline -3
docker compose -f infra\docker-compose.yml ps

# 2. 同步依赖
uv sync --extra dev

# 3. 迁移（S9 不新增；S1 的 6 张 S9 表应在）
uv run alembic upgrade head
uv run alembic downgrade base
uv run alembic upgrade head

# 4. 单元测试
uv run pytest tests\evidence\ tests\audit\ tests\benchmark\ tests\safety\ -v
uv run pytest tests -q   # 全量回归

# 5. Lint / Type
uv run ruff check src\ tests\
uv run mypy src\etl_agent\evidence\ src\etl_agent\audit\ src\etl_agent\benchmark\ src\etl_agent\safety\ src\etl_agent\config.py

# 6. 凭据零明文
Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File -Include "*.py","*.yml","*.yaml","*.ini","*.sql","*.toml","*.json" |
  Where-Object { $_.FullName -notmatch "\\\.git\\|\\\.venv\\" } |
  Select-String -Pattern "(password|secret|token)\s*=\s*['\`"][^'\`"]{3,}['\`"]"

# 7. AC-09 专项：六项门禁
uv run pytest tests\benchmark\test_gates.py -v

# 8. AC-14/15/16 专项：三层评测
uv run pytest tests\benchmark\test_l0_static.py tests\benchmark\test_l1_simulation.py tests\benchmark\test_l2_e2e.py -v

# 9. 端到端 Benchmark（CLI）
uv run etl-agent-benchmark --suite harness-v2 --version v1 --layers L0,L1
# 期望：六项门禁实际值 + 退出码 0

# 10. 代码注释抽检
Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File -Path src\etl_agent\ -Include "*.py" |
  Where-Object { $_.Name -ne "__init__.py" } |
  ForEach-Object {
    $head = Get-Content $_.FullName -TotalCount 10 -Raw
    if ($head -notmatch "SPEC 依据" -or $head -notmatch "覆盖 FR" -or $head -notmatch "对应 AC") {
      Write-Output "MISSING HEADER: $($_.FullName)"
    }
  }

# 11. .env 未被修改
Get-Content infra\.env | Select-String "FERNET_KEY|SEATUNNEL_URL"
# 期望：均为人类配置的值

# 12. Benchmark 冻结制品核对
Get-Content benchmarks\harness-v2\v1\manifest.json | Select-String "sha256"
```

